sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4\">Hizmetlerimiz</h2><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Çin ithalatının her aşamasında yanınızdayız</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"group bg-card rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"relative aspect-video bg-muted\"><img alt=\"Ürün Tedariği\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/service-sourcing.jpg\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/40 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-3 p-2 bg-white/90 dark:bg-gray-900/90 rounded-lg backdrop-blur-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search w-5 h-5 text-primary\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-2\">Ürün Tedariği</h3><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed\">Çin pazarında ihtiyacınız olan ürünleri en uygun fiyat ve kalitede araştırıyor, güvenilir tedarikçilerle buluşturuyoruz.</p></div></div><div class=\"group bg-card rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"relative aspect-video bg-muted\"><img alt=\"Kalite Kontrol\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"position:absolute;